{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4521","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4521/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4521/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4521/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/4521","id":109822024,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMDk4MjIwMjQ=","number":4521,"title":"[.38] Returning an Observable from EventEmitter ","user":{"login":"ericmdantas","id":7040162,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNDAxNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7040162?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas","html_url":"https://github.com/ericmdantas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericmdantas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null},{"id":218358951,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTgzNTg5NTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/effort1:%20hours","name":"effort1: hours","color":"bfe5bf","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/milestones/50","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/milestone/50","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/milestones/50/labels","id":1341479,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMTM0MTQ3OQ==","number":50,"title":"alpha-40","description":"Current milestone. Work on all issues to complete by Wednesday October 7 @ 8am PT. Only essential bugfixes to get alpha-38 fixed.","creator":{"login":"naomiblack","id":2286589,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODY1ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2286589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack","html_url":"https://github.com/naomiblack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naomiblack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":9,"state":"closed","created_at":"2015-10-06T22:09:23Z","updated_at":"2015-10-09T02:50:41Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2015-10-09T02:50:41Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2015-10-05T15:26:37Z","updated_at":"2019-09-07T07:22:11Z","closed_at":"2015-10-06T23:49:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Looks like we've got a problem with EventEmitters now. Either that or I'm missing something.\n\nHere is the plnkr with the situation: http://plnkr.co/edit/9w5nzAuMkE1BHoTo2GxN?p=preview\n\nBasically, we can't return an observable anymore when using `toRx()` see the change [here](https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/16bf335a4ae74155fef0d79f058dca0cf4d35fe4#diff-8be0a3d40b54a6a790fee3c42157b18dL141). \n\nWe can return an observable with `_subject`, though. But it just doesn't feel right. \n\nDoes anyone have any word on it? Should I still be using EventEmitter for that kind of situation or just switch to Rx's Observables?\n\nHere's the full code:\n\n``` js\nimport {Component, View, EventEmitter, OnInit, bootstrap} from 'angular2/angular2';\n\nclass SomethingService {\n  _ee: EventEmitter = new EventEmitter();\n\n  fireStuff() {\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      this._ee.next('fire!');\n    }, 1000);\n\n    //return this._ee.toRx(); - doesn't work anymore\n    return this._ee._subject; // silly work around\n  }\n}\n\n@Component({\n    selector: 'hello',\n    viewBindings: [SomethingService]\n})\n@View({\n    template: `\n      <h3>hello - uncomment line 11 and comment line 12 to see the error</h3>\n      <button type=\"button\"\n            (click)=\"fire()\">btn</button>\n    <pre [text-content]=\"f\"></pre>\n    `\n})\nexport class Hello implements OnInit {\n  f: string;\n\n  constructor(private _ss: SomethingService) {\n\n  }\n\n  onInit() {\n    console.log('hello init');\n  }\n\n  fire() {\n    this.f = \"loading\";\n\n    this._ss\n        .fireStuff()\n        .subscribe((info) => {\n          this.f = info;\n        });\n  }\n}\n\n\nbootstrap(Hello);\n```\n\nOld issue: #3580\n\ncc: @ericmartinezr @robwormald @pkozlowski-opensource \n","closed_by":{"login":"robwormald","id":534930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDkzMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/534930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald","html_url":"https://github.com/robwormald","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robwormald/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4521/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/4521/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}